-attribution defect rather than demonstrated core agreement failure.','The run ended with exit 101 because post-result actor join exceeded the harness\\\\'s two-second cleanup window. This failure and absent cleanup event are retained; no universal shutdown conclusion is inferred.'],limitations=['One unbatched, uncompacted, local-origin append_notify in a fixed three-node configuration with MemoryStorage, no restart.','Finite explicit leadership transition via public API and real timer interval; no deadline violation or global progress proof.','Does not establish all runtime notification variants or overall core consensus unsafety.','Actor shutdown did not complete in the two-second post-observation wait; cleanup ownership and closed-stream selection need separate investigation.'],report_title='日志替换后原写入仍返回成功',report_answer='固定执行中，值 101 的 append_notify 返回 Ok(1)，但该位置已由新任期决定为 202。消息来自真实三节点协议执行，原写入未到达多数派；现有 Superseded 分支未阻止此次错误成功。观测完成后的 actor 退出等待另行超时，未据此推断永久无法退出。')],feedback=dict(ref_ids=['d6c6f213390745ee9884b2c7b71b96c1','739a7fe5e829431788df0e6cbe41428f','7b63c5fa750747b29543e17e6b7da0d2','F-assignment','B-runtime-notification','M-actor'],answered='The fixed execution produced a fully correlated false success: admission requested 101; the joined original notification returned Ok(1); the live origin actor then reported decided index 1 and decided content [202]. The monitor comparison was violated with complete witness and no parsing errors. Exit 101 came afterward from the harness\\\\'s actor-join timeout, not from the comparison or its prerequisites.',remaining=['Controller assessment after correspondence review.','Independently investigate why actor join did not complete after handles were dropped; the finite timeout alone does not establish a shutdown violation.'],understanding='updated',rationale='No predicate, requirement or setup change is needed to assess the complete identity witness. Keep the post-observation lifecycle failure explicit instead of deleting it